	measure 'Retention Probability Movement' = ```
			CALCULATE (
			    SUMX (
			        fct_retention_changes,
			        fct_retention_changes[delta_retentionprobability]
			            * fct_retention_changes[cgplc_lastfyrevenuearo]
			    ),
			    fct_retention_changes[is_new] = FALSE ()
			)
			```
		formatString: #,0.00\ "€";-#,0.00\ "€";#,0.00\ "€"
		lineageTag: 26570368-1151-584b-bafc-ef5ad1a04e51

		annotation PBI_FormatHint = {"currencyCulture":"de-DE"}

